cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Per-Image Cue Weighting for Real-Time Decolorization on Edge Devices"
abstract: >-
  Code, trained models and result files for a per-image decolorization method that
  selects a convex weighting of four cues (R, G, B and an opponent-chroma axis) from a
  16-entry codebook using a 155k-parameter vision-transformer selector, with
  single-thread desktop and Raspberry Pi 5 deployment.
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rayeedaabir/decolorization"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22758732
keywords:
  - decolorization
  - color-to-grayscale
  - contrast preservation
  - vision transformer
  - edge computing
  - Raspberry Pi
